Baylee's music: the recordings in this directory
================================================

The score that plays these recordings is Baylee's own composition and code
(AGPL-3.0-only, see the repository's LICENSE). The recordings are prepared
(trimmed, mono, 44,100 Hz, looped) from three sources, each dedicated to the
public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal. CC0 asks for no credit; we give it.

